    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78723" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παράσειρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σειρά</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tied</i> or <i>fastened alongside</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἵππος</span> a horse <i>harnessed
				alongside</i> of the regular pair, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σειραφόρος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.141
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				4.50a
			</span></i> : metaph., <i>associate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1017
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			generally, <i>at the side</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				5.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				15.10
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παράσειρα, τά</span>, <i>parts on</i>
			<i>each side of the tongue</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Onom.</u>
				57
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.107
			</span></i>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περισείρια ; δύο [πλευραὶ]
			π</span>. two <i>lowest of the true ribs</i>, ib. <i><span class="en">
				182
			</span></i>.</div>
